  "method": "For each slot include the sum across all ranks, both DPs and entire target replays whose earliest TP worker entry (host monotonic clock) precedes that client deadline. Unbound entries receive full credit. Subtract the sum once per unique label from each original endpoint, floor at zero, then recompute nearest-rank P90 or makespan. Both are maxima for eight requests.",
  "limits": "Fixed original dependency graph and unchanged work, gaps, resources and scheduling outside the selected tasks. Only recorded named target-graph tasks can change. Earlier readers, new data ownership, eager/draft/host work, changed contention, speculative acceptance or batching require new scopes. Cost above the guide proves only sufficient gross budget. Overlapping rank work and collective waiting are deliberately overcredited.",
